zI1NzYs/aF8xNzMzLHhfMCx5/XzAsY19maWxsL2hf/NDQ3\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"main\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"has\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"\",\n    \"audio\": {\n      \"title\": \"Short Change Hero\",\n      \"artist\": \"The Heavy\",\n      \"cover\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/cVj--3ASFwW7yW8KMqWwv5qtz9ZPlC1InnGiO6JI6Hw/rs:fit:500:0:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9pLnNj/ZG4uY28vaW1hZ2Uv/YWI2NzYxNmQwMDAw/MWUwMjUwZjJjZGM3/YTBkYWRhYTA1NjQ4/ZjA4Ng\",\n      \"url\": \"https://audio.jukehost.co.uk/019fcd7f-3bf1-7393-a786-3400aa6ec8dc\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \">=\",\n    \"amount\": 270,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Comeback Kid\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"Romney defies the odds, beating McRaven\",\n    \"content\": \"\",\n    \"image\": \"\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"main\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"ignore\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \"==\",\n    \"amount\": 538,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Mitt Romney's dissapearance\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"That's what the newspapers wrote. That's what was on the front page. It didn't matter. No one cared anymore. Most just sighed as if it was another Tuesday. For many it was. Mitt Romney was supposed to be a god in human clothing at a victory like this. But now. Now people just wanted to forget. Forget the past. Forget the mistakes. Forget America. This was no longer the country they loved. For many life lost its meaning. America was still the same on the outside but inside, it was hollow. It was no longer the same. It was lost.\",\n    \"image\": \"\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"secondary\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"has\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"20820\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"20820\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \">=\",\n    \"amount\": 270,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"The Romney Legacy\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"<p>Ever since Mitt Romney's victory in the 2016 presidential election, many have wondered what the Romney's legacy will be.</p> <p> We all know Mitt and his father however it's been clear that the family's place in the Republican party isn't going away anytime soon. Mitt managed to clinch the presidency away from Barrack Obama in a divisive way but we have seen that the people didn't care and chose him yet again. This victory has cemented Mitt as the modern Truman and has given his world view the validation it lacked all throughout his first term. He might be one of the lucky few presidents who won't suffer from the 2nd term curse. </p>\",\n    \"image\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/spg-O0ILqjDLKGkbPUG0LJlzCuTTMZGOCJnH3ToAcUU/rs:fit:860:0:0:0/g:\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"secondary\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"ignore\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \"<\",\n    \"amount\": 269,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"The Romney Legacy\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"<p>Mitt, just like his father, has been proven to be a failed presidential candidate</p>\",\n    \"image\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/spg-O0ILqjDLKGkbPUG0LJlzCuTTMZGOCJnH3ToAcUU/rs:fit:860:0:0:0/g:\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"secondary\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"ignore\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \"==\",\n    \"amount\": 0,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Romney apologists keep claiming he is misunderstood\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"<p>Despite Romney's horrific defeat in the 2016 election many people claim that he is misunderstood and that his loss isn't his fault</p> <p>Many claim that had Huckabee not ran third party Romney might've been able to win. They claim that Romney could've easily broken 200 electoral votes had Huckabee not splintered the party</p>\",\n    \"image\": \"\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"secondary\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"ignore\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \">=\",\n    \"amount\": 270,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Will Ryan manage to carry Romney's legacy?\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"<p> Despite being his vice president for 8 years now, people wonder about Paul Ryan's electability for the 2020 election.</p> <p>Paul Ryan is highly conservative, a quite stark difference to the more moderate administration of Mitt Romney. Ryan however isn't without his advantages. He holds support in the Midwest and with a potential Ryan/Pawlenty ticket, we could see the Midwest turn into a more reliably red region.</p>\",\n    \"image\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/FTYxlKrap4asUwVv5MQ5ha-h4Ppy_Pe_uJW3OnPeL9A/rs:fit:500:0:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxv/YWQud2lraW1lZGlh/Lm9yZy93aWtpcGVk/aWEvY29tbW9ucy9i/L2I2L1BhdWxfUnlh/bl93aXRoX01pdHRf/Um9tbmV5X2luX05v/cmZvbGssX1Zpcmdp/bmlhXzgtMTEtMTIu/anBn\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"extra-3\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"has\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"5003\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"5003\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \"<\",\n    \"amount\": 269,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Has Romney dragged Ryan down with him?\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"<p>Paul Ryan, despite his controversies, was seen as a major player for the 202 election. This seems to be over now, since Romney's loss in the 2016 election</p>\",\n    \"image\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/4sGwlg5JQl3U2ameEMha6Siz9k72SThHjrZQyarH7K4/rs:fit:500:0:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWRp/YS5nZXR0eWltYWdl/cy5jb20vaWQvODIz/OTA3Mjg2L3Bob3Rv/L3dhc2hpbmd0b24t/ZGMtc3BlYWtlci1v/Zi10aGUtaG91c2Ut/cGF1bC1yeWFuLWxl/YXZlcy10aGUtaG91/c2UtZ29wLXdlZWts/eS1jb25mZXJlbmNl/LWF0LXRoZS11cy5q/cGc_cz02MTJ4NjEy/Jnc9MCZrPTIwJmM9/MWttVE1JeHFEbXpl/OTVNNnVwUm1wcDNY/MkZXaWtib1IxNHB6/cFJaNzFLcz0\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"extra-3\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"has\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"5003\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"5003\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \"==\",\n    \"amount\": 538,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"2036- 20 years of the White House being abandonned\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"Every since Mitt Romney's disappearance in 2016 the White House has been left abandoned. No one wanted it. No one wanted to stay in it. It has been kept up by the new administrations but it is still filled with dust. The outside looks the same. The inside is empty. It has been. For 20 years\",\n    \"image\": \"\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"extra-3\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"ignore\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \">\",\n    \"amount\": 269,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Tim Pawlenty's road to the Whitehouse\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"Despite initially rejecting the offer, Tim Pawlenty has chosen to run for President. His path is easy given his high support\",\n    \"image\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/GO_E4tbAwZyOR_uTOhm5-T6lqV-V4erNiVJEf-RMF6k/rs:fit:500:0:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWRp/YS5nZXR0eWltYWdl/cy5jb20vaWQvMTA5/MDEwOTE0L3Bob3Rv/L3dhc2hpbmd0b24t/ZGMtZm9ybWVyLW1p/bm5lc290YS1nb3Zl/cm5vci10aW0tcGF3/bGVudHktYWRkcmVz/c2VzLXRoZS1jb25z/ZXJ2YXRpdmUtcG9s/aXRpY2FsLmpwZz9z/PTYxMng2MTImdz0w/Jms9MjAmYz1aWVNS/eWprem1LNkt2aHdT/ZnpKbjZvczhYYk16/eXg5S1BhMWhvd1dv/bjB3PQ\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"extra-3\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"has\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"5004\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"5004\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \">\",\n    \"amount\": 269,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Is Christie going to Run?\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"Despite being Romney's VP, Chris Christie isn't popular at all. His path to President is extraordinarily slim, unlike him\",\n    \"image\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/666XPIAgMmdqIdef1EG_agtkVgpaHTxd_o9B0tXTUOc/rs:fit:500:0:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWRp/YS5jbm4uY29tL2Fw/aS92MS9pbWFnZXMv/c3RlbGxhci9wcm9k/LzIzMDUzMDExMzEx/OC1jaHJpcy1jaHJp/c3RpZS0yMDA5Mjcu/anBnP2M9b3JpZ2lu/YWwmcT13XzExODIs/Y19maWxs\",\n    \"slideGroup\": \"extra-3\",\n    \"variableConditions\": [],\n    \"variableConditionOperator\": \"AND\",\n    \"answerConditionType\": \"has\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswer\": \"\",\n    \"answerConditionAnswers\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"variable\": 0,\n    \"operator\": \">\",\n    \"amount\": 270,\n    \"outcomeCondition\": \"ignore\",\n    \"title\": \"Haley drops out of the 2020 Republican Primaries\",\n    \"subtitle\": \"\",\n    \"content\": \"\",\n    \"image\": \"https://imgs.search.brave.com/CPkEZjfdBvEeyTTeaL8QD_5IQ7qsK